In my nethack dream last night I was attempting the "containerless"
ascension, and with quite a broad definition of container.  In addition
to the obvious requirements for such a conduct (no looting or applying
bags, chests, etc), I wasn't allowed to take advantage of anything that
would be stored inside another thing.  Potions and lamps, in
particular, were not allowed.

Would a real containerless conduct be an interesting addition to
nethack?  I can only seriously suggest the simplified version of course
(no looting or applying chests, bags).  It seems like there might be
enough alternative ways to open chests to make it interesting without
being impossible.  The biggest problem, I expect, is going without the
bag of holding.

Anyway, it was a conduct that gave me a lot of trouble, in the dream,
because I was spending a lot of time sacrificing rocks.  Hauling those
things to the altar is a pain when you have no way to lighten the load.

